000E1Dr 2  A9 23            lda #$23
000E1Fr 2  8D 06 20         sta $2006
000E22r 2  A9 C0            lda #$C0
000E24r 2  8D 06 20         sta $2006
000E27r 2               
000E27r 2  A0 00            ldy #00
000E29r 2                 AttributePage1Loop:
