000E3Er 2  AD rr rr         LDA nameTable
000E41r 2  49 01            EOR #$01
000E43r 2  0A               ASL A
000E44r 2  0A               ASL A
000E45r 2  18               CLC
000E46r 2  69 23            ADC #$23
000E48r 2  8D rr rr         STA colHig
000E4Br 2               
000E4Br 2  AD rr rr         LDA scrollPosition
000E4Er 2  4A               LSR A
000E4Fr 2  4A               LSR A
000E50r 2  4A               LSR A
000E51r 2  4A               LSR A
000E52r 2  4A               LSR A
