000E8Dr 2  AD rr rr         LDA colLow
000E90r 2  8D 06 20         STA $2006
000E93r 2  B1 rr            LDA (sourceLow), y
000E95r 2  8D 07 20         STA $2007
000E98r 2               
000E98r 2  C8               INY
000E99r 2  C0 06            CPY #$06
