000ED6r 2  AD rr rr         LDA sourceLow
000ED9r 2  18               CLC
000EDAr 2  6D rr rr         ADC lowMapByte
000EDDr 2  8D rr rr         STA sourceLow
000EE0r 2  AD rr rr         LDA sourceHig
