000EF4r 2  AD rr rr         LDA colHig
000EF7r 2  8D 06 20         STA $2006             ; write the high byte of column address
000EFAr 2  AD rr rr         LDA colLow
000EFDr 2  8D 06 20         STA $2006             ; write the low byte of column address
000F00r 2  A2 1A            LDX #$1A              ; copy 1E - 30 bytes 18 - 24
000F02r 2  A0 00            LDY #$00
